        <item>
            <title>0.3.3</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 17:19:14 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>339</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[A friendlier way to update

- Settings has an Updates row: check for updates and see where it stands
- A new version shows as Update at the top left of the list and cards, clear of the notch
- Check for updates now answers even when an update is already on its way
- On an external display the notch tucks away instead of fading
- Smoother spinners and more room between the rows in Settings
]]></description>
